# URLs the external Markdown-link sweep should skip: those that legitimately
# 403/404 while unauthenticated (a 404 can be an existence-hiding response), or
# hosts that rate-limit unauthenticated bots. One regex per line; `#` comments
# supported. Regenerate from this repo's own token-enabled sweep — never copy
# another repo's entries (see flungo/github-workflows
# docs/runbooks/adopting-markdown-workflows.md).
